# Third-party data attribution

## Fashionpedia ontology extract
`lib/search/fashionpedia-ontology.json` is an extract (category and
attribute names + supercategories only — no images, no annotations) of the
Fashionpedia dataset ontology:

  Menglin Jia, Mengyun Shi, Mikhail Sirotenko, Yin Cui, Claire Cardie,
  Bharath Hariharan, Hartwig Adam, Serge Belongie.
  "Fashionpedia: Ontology, Segmentation, and an Attribute Localization
  Dataset", ECCV 2020.
  https://github.com/cvdfoundation/fashionpedia

The Fashionpedia annotations and ontology are licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://fashionpedia.github.io/home/data_license.html). The extract was
produced by scripts/extract-fashionpedia.mjs; the curated crosswalk into
ASILUM's category space lives in lib/search/ontology.js.
